    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>138.4</mn></math>  days, t = 69.2 day<br/><br/>        Number of half-lifes  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>69.2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>138.4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>        Amount of Po left  <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  after half-life  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.707</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> <br/><br/>        Amount of Po used in  <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  half-life  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.707</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.293</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> <br/><br/>        Now  <math><msub><mrow/><mrow><mn>84</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>210</mn></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow/><mrow><mn>82</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>206</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow/><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>        210 g Po on decay will produce = 4g He<br/><br/>        0.293 g Po on decay will produce  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mn>0.293</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></mrow><mrow><mn>210</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5.581</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math> <br/><br/>        Volume of He at STP  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5.581</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mn>22400</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>31.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>31.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
